error[SCXML064]: `<state>` has 2 `<initial>` children, but allows at most one
 --> tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml:4:6
  |
3 |     <initial><transition target="a1"/></initial>
  |      ------- first `<initial>`
4 |     <initial><transition target="a2"/></initial>
  |      ^^^^^^^ second `<initial>`
  |
  = note: a `<state>` has at most one `<initial>`: it is the one default entry transition of the state
  = help: keep one `<initial>`; to enter several parallel descendants, list them all as targets of its one `<transition>`
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>
help: remove the second `<initial>`
  |
4 -     <initial><transition target="a2"/></initial>

error[SCXML064]: `<send>` has 2 `<content>` children, but allows at most one
 --> tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml:8:10
  |
7 |         <content>first</content>
  |          ------- first `<content>`
8 |         <content>second</content>
  |          ^^^^^^^ second `<content>`
  |
  = note: `<send>` carries at most one `<content>`: it is the whole event payload, so a second one has no meaning
  = help: keep the one `<content>` that is the payload; to send several values, use `<param>` children or one structured `<content>`
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>
help: remove the second `<content>`
  |
