error[SCXML064]: `<invoke>` has 2 `<finalize>` children, but allows at most one
  --> tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml:15:8
   |
14 |       <finalize><log expr="'one'"/></finalize>
   |        -------- first `<finalize>`
15 |       <finalize><log expr="'two'"/></finalize>
   |        ^^^^^^^^ second `<finalize>`
   |
   = note: `<invoke>` takes at most one `<finalize>`: it is the one block that processes each event the invoked service returns
   = help: merge the executable content into one `<finalize>`
   = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>
help: remove the second `<finalize>`
